ar en vijftig jaar door vechten.","eind":"،"},{"woorden":[{"w":"فَلِمَاذَا","ids":["fa","limadha"]},{"w":"لَا","ids":["la"]},{"w":"يُقَاتِلُونَ","ids":["qatal"]},{"w":"عَلَى","ids":["ala"]},{"w":"هٰذَا","ids":["hadha"]},{"w":"الشَّرَفِ","ids":["al","sharaf"]}],"nl":"Waarom zouden ze dan niet vechten om deze eer?","eind":"؟"},{"woorden":[{"w":"وَإِنَّهُ","ids":["wa","inna","_hu"]},{"w":"لَشَرَفٌ","ids":["li","sharaf"]},{"w":"عَظِيمٌ","ids":["azim"]}],"nl":"En het is werkelijk een grote eer.","eind":""},{"woorden":[{"w":"وَقَرَّبَتْ","ids":["wa","qarrab"]},{"w":"قَبِيلَةٌ","ids":["qabilah"]},{"w":"مِنْ","ids":["min"]},{"w":"قُرَيْشٍ","ids":["quraysh"]},{"w":"جَفْنَةً","ids":["jafnah"]},{"w":"مَمْلُوءَةً","ids":["mamlu"]},{"w":"دَماً","ids":["dam"]},{"w":"ثُمَّ","ids":["thumma"]},{"w":"تَحَالَفَتْ","ids":["tahalaf"]},{"w":"مَعَ","ids":["maa_h"]},{"w":"قَبِيلَةٍ","ids":["qabilah"]},{"w":"أُخْرَى","ids":["ukhra"]},{"w":"عَلَى","ids":["ala"]},{"w":"الْمَوْتِ","ids":["al","mawt"]},{"w":"وَأَدْخَلُوا","ids":["wa","dakhal"]},{"w":"أَيْدِيَهُمْ","ids":["yad","_hum"]},{"w":"فِي","ids":["fi"]},{"w":"ذٰلِكَ","ids":["dhalika"]},{"w":"الدَّمِ","ids":["al","dam"]},{"w":"وَقَالُوا","ids":["wa","qal"]}],"nl":"Een stam van de Qoeraisj zette een met bloed gevulde schaal neer, sloot daarna met een andere stam een verbond tot de dood, ze staken hun handen in dat bloed en zeiden:","eind":":"},{"woorden":[{"w":"لَا","ids":["la"]},{"w":"نَتْرُكُ","ids":["tarak"]},{"w":"هٰذَا","ids":["hadha"]},{"w":"الشَّرَفَ","ids":["al","sharaf"]},{"w":"أَوْ","ids":["aw"]},{"w":"نَمُوتَ","ids":["mat"]}],"nl":"Wij laten deze eer niet los, of wij sterven.","eind":""},{"woorden":[{"w":"وَكَانَ","ids":["wa","kan"]},{"w":"هٰذَا","ids":["hadha"]},{"w":"شَرًّا","ids":["sharr"]},{"w":"كَبِيراً","ids":["kabir"]},{"w":"وَخَطَراً","ids":["wa","khatar"]},{"w":"عَظِيماً","ids":["azim"]},{"w":"وَالْمَوْتُ","ids":["wa","al","mawt"]},{"w":"شَيْءٌ","ids":["shay"]},{"w":"هَيِّنٌ","ids":["hayyin"]},{"w":"لِلْعَرَبِ","ids":["